<title>PHILIPPINES: Reynolds debuts lower at 4.50 pesos.</title>
<headline>Reynolds debuts lower at 4.50 pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aluminium producer Reynolds Philippines Corp made its debut on the Philippine stock market at 4.50 pesos per share from an offer price of 4.55 pesos, brokers said.</p>
<p>The share slipped to a low of 4.05 pesos minutes after the opening.  </p>
<p>About 2.454 million Reynolds shares were traded in the first five minutes.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
